      "writtenOn": "2022-06-09T15:02:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s a followup CL coming which will add explicit address space modifiers, following the Metal model (device, thread, threadgroup, constant). Likewise with uniforms, Metal doesn\u0027t even have uniforms, so I\u0027m not necessarily convinced there\u0027s a lot of value in adding support for them in this context.",
      "parentUuid": "4c214804_c1d97062",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2,
